{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GdbJC8yxOrDMPSEvLzgnfw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:35.973413+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GdbJC8yxOrDMPSEvLzgnfw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>紧扣学校“三海一核”办学特色，遵循学校“五个注重，五个坚持”办学原则，服务“强核报国”育人核心，落实高质量育人使命。学院将开展2026暑期本科人才能力提升行动，搭建“知识强化、技能提升、实践赋能、学术交叉”综合培养平台，强化人才培养与行业需求的适配性，夯实学生专业基础、拓宽交叉学科视野、锤炼工程实践能力，为我国核工业高质量发展储备后备人才，现面向校内外优秀学生开放报名！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>参与对象</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>核科学与技术学院大一、大二本科生自愿报名参加；同时面向校内其他理工科专业优秀学生、外校拟保研至我院的优秀本科生开放少量名额。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>2026年7月20日-8月9日，共3周。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>内容</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>交叉课程模块、专业技能培训模块、学术报告模块、项目实践模块</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>目标</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>（1）知识目标：加深核科学与技术核心知识掌握程度，拓展交叉学科知识储备，了解核行业前沿技术与发展趋势，完善完整专业知识体系。</span></p><p><span>（2）能力目标：熟练掌握核学科专业工具软件操作，锻炼跨学科思维、学术探究与团队协作能力，提升解决实际工程问题的综合能力。</span></p><p><span>（3）素养目标：传承中国核工业精神，树立“强核报国”理想与正确职业观，激发科研探索兴趣，全面提升升学、就业核心竞争力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>考核评价</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>坚持“公开、公平、公正、诚信”原则，课程考勤统一记录，纳入综合考核。除统一课程学习外，所有参训同学将划分至各基层组织，同步开展项目实践。学生依托各基层组织开展总结答辩，全面考核学生的学习态度、知识掌握、技能提升与实践成果，优秀者颁发荣誉证书，给予一定奖励。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>本次暑期行动覆盖核工程主流研究方向，融合理论授课、仿真实操、论文写作、科研实践等板块，是积累科研经历、夯实专业功底、提升升学就业竞争力的优质平台。欢迎同学们积极报名，扫描下方二维码。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7Y0EibsoiaU7C8I84QRLuBzfeicXzN7oqvDialpIS36JjEWhYicjAwwbvm7qP3yPPZkNE0cbNHV6W7HYibUHibljXNn3QW1eNTlafgibp2yupFo0LU8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><